title: "Battery Characterization Datasets: 24-hour OCV Relaxation and Charge-Discharge Voltage Curves"
abstract: >-
  Open experimental datasets for rechargeable-battery research: (1) 24-hour
  open-circuit-voltage relaxation for 8 cells across six chemistries, and
  (2) charge/discharge voltage curves for 10 LiFePO4 cells. Released under CC BY 4.0.
